#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "What are the AI transpiler passes and how to use them"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que les passes de transpilation IA et comment les utiliser"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI-powered transpiler passes"
msgstr "Passes de transpilation assistées par IA"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/ai-transpiler-passes.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/ai-transpiler-passes.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Eprint */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore Eprint */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The AI-powered transpiler passes are passes that work as a drop-in "
"replacement of \"traditional\" Qiskit passes for some transpiling tasks. "
"They often produce better results than existing heuristic algorithms (such "
"as lower depth and CNOT count), but are also much faster than optimization "
"algorithms such as Boolean satisfiability solvers. The AI transpiler passes "
"run on your local environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les passes de transpilation assistées par IA sont des passes qui remplacent "
"directement les passes Qiskit « traditionnelles » pour certaines tâches de "
"transpilation. Elles produisent souvent de meilleurs résultats que les "
"algorithmes heuristiques existants (comme une profondeur et un nombre de "
"CNOT plus faibles), tout en étant beaucoup plus rapides que des algorithmes "
"d'optimisation tels que les solveurs de satisfaisabilité booléenne. Les "
"passes de transpilation IA s'exécutent dans ton environnement local.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The AI-powered transpiler passes are in beta release status, subject to change.\n"
"If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, please use this [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.slack.com/archives/C06KF8YHUAU).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Les passes de transpilation assistées par IA sont en version bêta et sont susceptibles d'évoluer.\n"
"Si tu as des commentaires ou si tu veux contacter l'équipe de développement, utilise ce [canal Qiskit Slack Workspace](https://qiskit.slack.com/archives/C06KF8YHUAU).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following passes are currently available:\n"
msgstr "Les passes suivantes sont actuellement disponibles :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Routing passes**\n"
" - `AIRouting`: Layout selection and circuit routing\n"
msgstr ""
"**Passes de routage**\n"
" - `AIRouting` : Sélection du layout et routage de circuit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Circuit synthesis passes**\n"
" - `AICliffordSynthesis`: Clifford circuit synthesis\n"
" - `AILinearFunctionSynthesis`: Linear function circuit synthesis\n"
" - `AIPermutationSynthesis`: Permutation circuit synthesis\n"
msgstr ""
"**Passes de synthèse de circuit**\n"
" - `AICliffordSynthesis` : Synthèse de circuit Clifford\n"
" - `AILinearFunctionSynthesis` : Synthèse de circuit à fonction linéaire\n"
" - `AIPermutationSynthesis` : Synthèse de circuit de permutation\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use the AI transpiler passes, first install the `qiskit-ibm-transpiler` "
"package. Visit the [qiskit-ibm-transpiler API "
"documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-transpiler) to "
"get more information about the different options available.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour utiliser les passes de transpilation IA, installe d'abord le package "
"`qiskit-ibm-transpiler`. Consulte la [documentation API de qiskit-ibm-"
"transpiler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-transpiler) pour en "
"savoir plus sur les différentes options disponibles.\n"

